                        "review": "There is a stupid bug with the game. It tries to start \"TheTowerVive.exe\" which doesn't exist. Instead, it should be \"The Tower Vive.exe\" (wtf 1?). In order to solve this I had to duplicate both the exe and a data folder, without spaces in its names.\nAlso, as soon as you start the game I get an error saying \"verification failed\", although I'm able to play (wtf 2?).\nThere is also a nasty bug were you can fall into tho bottom for ever, never hitting the end (wtf 3?)\nGame is ok, although a little annoying. \n\nVR accessibility score\n-----------------------\nOne-handed = 10/10\nWheelchair = 0/10",
